just1nlee.com
=============

My personal website.

Why
---

I wanted to create a place to express myself and finally make use of the just1nlee.com domain name I bought. I also wanted to use this site as an exercise to refresh my web development skills. Everything you see was written in pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, without the use of any frameworks. I created the pixel art sprites and animations in Aseprite.

Credits
-------

Monkey sprite based on original art by apple jelly, used with permission:
https://www.reddit.com/r/PixelArt/comments/lrusgr/monkey/
